--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonikaIsASneakySneaker
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151372
    - rid: 8164893287844151373
    - rid: 8164893287844151374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Every day, I imagine a future where I can be with you~)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151375
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '(Dee da-diddly-la dee! Boo da ba booboo ba boo-) '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (How long have <b>you</b> there...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595906
    - rid: 8164893304793595907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I was just, uh, just trying to pass the time...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595908
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've been up on this hill, for a couple hours now, keeping watch.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595909
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We actually found a nice place to keep safe while we sleep-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595910
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (There's this old watchtower further up the hill that we holed ourselves
      up in.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595911
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Some necromancer was hiding up there, but we took care of him pretty
      quick.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595912
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, I was rambling, wasn't I?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595913
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm just happy I've got someone to talk to-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595914
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Especially if that somebody is <b>you</b>.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595915
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Actually, now that I'm thinking about it...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Why <i>are</i> <b>you</b> here?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595917
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I could've sworn that <b>you'd</b> follow wherever the action is.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if that's entirely true.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: While it does seem like my perspective jumps around to someone else whenever
      there's a pause in the action...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Seemingly, these jumps take me around between all of the... side-plots
      for lack of a better term.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Side-plots? What do you mean by that?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, the girls and {mc} are all doing things, even while the group
      is separated-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: So while the group <i>is</i> separated, I hop between each person as
      they pursue their own goals.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh, I see. I think I get it.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So you've seen everyone else today, then?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595918
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Since there's no way what I'm doing is at all interesting compared to
      what they're up to, ahaha!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (What <i>are</i> the others up to, anyway?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595920
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Last I saw of her, Natsuki's working on her new armor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595921
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Is she finally getting some sleeves?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I think so...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595923
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri had to deal with some Thalmor questioning back in Winterhold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595924
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Because of the Ancano thing?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: After that she made her down to Whiterun and is taking a break at Jorrvaskr.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (One of us taking a break?!? Perish the thought!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595925
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Good for her.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Last, but not least, {mc} and Sayori are doing some package-retrieval
      job... quest... thing for Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Didn't I tell Sayori not to do anything of note with {mc}?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595928
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Well I'm here right now, aren't I? Even though you're doing nothing of
      note?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595929
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, I'm pretty sure that the entity is going to keep throwing plot
      elements at {mc} so he doesn't become too lethargic.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595930
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I didn't really consider that.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (In a sick sort of sense that's good for us-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc}'s literally got the power set of a main character; fights would
      be way easier with him around...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But I doubt keeping him on edge all the time would improve his mental
      health...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595933
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you think-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595935
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595934
    - rid: 8164893304793595936
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In the distance, Monika is able to notice a figure coming out of the
      Sanctuary door.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595938
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595937
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Burly guy, seems to have gray hair, comically spooky outfit-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And no shoes...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So there are at least two members here:)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That guy and Gabriella.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The burly man starts heading his way toward Falkreath town.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (What're the odds that something happens when <b>you</b> show up, eh?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, no, it was just a joke- don't go-!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793595997
